---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Shadow Cloak in Stand Out – How to Get, Vampire Sunlight Immunity & Stats | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Learn how to get the Shadow Cloak in Roblox STAND OUT. View exact drop locations, Old Mansion graveyard chest odds, Vampire daylight burn immunity, and comparisons with Black Umbrella."
  canonicalPath="items/shadow-cloak"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Items', href: '/items/' },
    { label: 'Shadow Cloak' }
  ]}
  schemaType="Article"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge & Title -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-900 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 border border-purple-200">
        <span>Vampire Gear</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Rare Accessory</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Shadow Cloak in Stand Out
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        The ultimate survival gear for Vampire race players in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong>. Equipping the Shadow Cloak grants total daylight burn immunity without taking up your weapon or combat hand slot.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Fact Summary Card -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs mb-10">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Item Type</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Accessory / Back Slot</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Primary Effect</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-purple-700 mt-1">100% Sun Immunity</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Obtain Source</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-slate-900 mt-1">Old Mansion Graveyard</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Race Compatibility</div>
        <div class="text-base font-black text-rose-700 mt-1">Vampire Only</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Direct Answer Section: How to Get -->
    <section class="mb-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        How to Get the Shadow Cloak in Stand Out
      </h2>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-4 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          The <strong>Shadow Cloak</strong> (internally registered in game files as the <em>Vampire Cloak</em>) can be obtained through two verified methods in the current version of STAND OUT:
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-purple-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs">1</span>
              Old Mansion Graveyard Chest (Primary)
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Travel to the Old Mansion district on the outskirts of Honolulu. Behind the mansion lies the forgotten graveyard. A treasure chest spawns in the crypt cemetery every 30 to 45 minutes with a confirmed drop chance for the Shadow Cloak.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1.5">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-purple-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs">2</span>
              Shadow NPC Trader Exchange
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              During in-game nighttime, a hooded Vampire contact appears inside the underground storm drainage canal. You can trade <strong>3x Dark Fabric</strong> (from nocturnal cultist mobs) plus <strong>$15,000 Dalas</strong> for the cloak.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Shadow Cloak vs Black Umbrella Comparison -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Shadow Cloak vs. Black Umbrella: Which is Better?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-6">
        Both items protect Vampire players from lethal daytime sunlight, but their combat utility differs dramatically:
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 uppercase text-[11px] font-bold">
              <th class="p-4">Feature</th>
              <th class="p-4 text-purple-700">Shadow Cloak (Best)</th>
              <th class="p-4 text-slate-700">Black Umbrella (Budget)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Equipment Slot</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-700 font-bold">Accessory (Back / Cape)</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-rose-700 font-bold">Handheld Weapon Slot</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Combat Capability</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-700 font-bold">Full Combat: All Stand moves &amp; combos enabled</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-rose-700 font-bold">Severe: Cannot use light attacks or two-handed moves</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Sprint &amp; Mobility</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-700 font-bold">100% normal sprint and dash speed</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-amber-700">Sprint allowed, but closing umbrella causes instant sun burn</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Price / Obtainment</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-700 font-medium">Graveyard Chest or $15k Dalas + Dark Fabric</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-emerald-700 font-bold">Cheap: $800 Dalas at Big Chop Store</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Verdict</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-purple-700 font-black">Mandatory for competitive Vampire PvP &amp; Raids</td>
              <td class="p-4 text-slate-600">Temporary starter item until you find the cloak</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Vampire Mechanics Context -->
    <section class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-amber-900 mb-2">Vampire Sunlight Mechanics in Stand Out</h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-950/80 leading-relaxed">
        Under direct sunlight without cover, Vampire players suffer continuous fire damage (15% maximum HP per second) and lose HP regeneration. Wearing the Shadow Cloak completely neutralizes this debuff, allowing you to participate in daytime Honolulu events, complete outdoor NPC bounties, and engage in outdoor PvP without fearing sunrise.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Cross Navigation Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <a
        href="/vampire/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Race Overview</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors">Vampire Race &amp; Traits →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">View regeneration stats, blood bar, and Stone Mask transformation.</p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/guides/vampire/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Walkthrough</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors">Vampire Progression Guide →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Step-by-step questline to awaken vampirism and master blood drain.</p>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/accessories/"
        class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-md transition-all group"
      >
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Gear Database</div>
        <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors">All Accessories &amp; Drops →</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Browse DIO's Jacket, Jotaro's Pants, and SWAT gear stats.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
